## Canon Compliance

### ✅ Canon Respected
- No direct GGUF parsing in brain/master (delegates to hacedle)
- ModelSpec architecture extracted from metadata (no hardcoding)
- FAN Registry pattern followed in structure

### ⚠️ Canon Violations
- `loader.rs` calls non-existent `GgufLoader::load_std()`
- Tensor loading methods undefined (metadata.rs MISSING)
- Sampler Engine not integrated

